        "respondWith": "showText",
        "responseText": "=<h2>Your dubbed video is ready</h2>\n<p>Job <code>{{ $json.job_id }}</code> &mdash; {{ $json.source_language }} to {{ $json.target_language }}, {{ $json.segments }} segments.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Transcribed with Whisper <b>{{ $json.whisper_model }}</b></li>\n<li>Translated with <b>{{ $json.translation_engine }}</b></li>\n<li>Voiced by <b>{{ $json.voice_used || $json.voice_engine }}</b></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"{{ $json.download_video }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download the dubbed video (MP4, subtitles included)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"{{ $json.download_subtitle }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download the translated subtitles (SRT)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Both links keep working while the stack is up. The job folder is <code>data/jobs/{{ $json.job_id }}</code>.</p>",
        "limitWaitTime": false,
        "options": {}
      },
